          "modules": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "<p>Join us for the <strong><strong>exciting world wide premiere</strong></strong> of the psychological thriller <strong><strong>Remembrance</strong></strong>! Experience this gripping film on the big screen, for one night only, at the iconic <strong><strong>Genesis Cinema</strong></strong>. Hosted by the <em><em>brilliant </em></em><strong><strong>Kayas Irshad</strong></strong>!</p><p>The premiere will take place on <strong><strong>October 16, 2026, with doors opening at 4:30 PM</strong></strong> (BST). Don’t miss this exclusive opportunity to be among the first to witness this thrilling cinematic journey in person.</p><p>We look forward to welcoming you to an unforgettable evening of suspense!</p><p><br></p>",
