              },
              {
                "question": "What time should I arrive?",
                "answer": "Doors open at 4:30pm for VIP ticket holders, and 5pm for Standard ticket holders. We recommend arriving early to allow time for check-in, experiencing the red carpet, mingling with industry professionals and getting settled before the film begins at 6:00pm"
